                                <div class="plus">
                                  <svg
                                    width="17"
                                    height="14"
                                    viewBox="0 0 17 14"
                                    fill="none"
                                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                  >
                                    <path
                                      d="M8.16064 1.41406V13.1053"
                                      stroke="#303A42"
                                      stroke-width="1.69884"
                                      stroke-linecap="round"
                                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    />
                                    <path
                                      d="M1.0249 7.25977H15.2971"
                                      stroke="#303A42"
                                      stroke-width="1.69884"
                                      stroke-linecap="round"
                                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    />
                                  </svg>
                                </div>
                                <div class="minus">
                                  <svg
                                    width="17"
                                    height="2"
                                    viewBox="0 0 17 2"
                                    fill="none"
                                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                  >
                                    <path
                                      d="M1.30957 1.01367H15.5818"
                                      stroke="#7F56D9"
                                      stroke-width="1.69884"
                                      stroke-linecap="round"
                                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    />
                                  </svg>
                                </div>
                              </div>
                            </button>
                          </h5>
                        </div>

                        <div
                          id="collapseOne"
                          class="collapse show"
                          aria-labelledby="headingOne"
                          data-parent="#accordion"
                        >
                          <div class="card-body">
                            The duration of this course is 6 months with 5 days
                            of classes in a week.
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="card">
                        <div class="card-header" id="headingTwo">
                          <h5 class="mb-0">
                            <button
                              class="btn btn-link collapsed"
                              data-toggle="collapse"
                              data-target="#collapseTwo"
                              aria-expanded="false"
                              aria-controls="collapseTwo"
                            >
                              Do I need any prior experience to enroll in the
                              Graphics Design course?
                              <div class="faq_icon position-relative">
                                <div class="plus">
                                  <svg
                                    width="17"
                                    height="14"
                                    viewBox="0 0 17 14"
                                    fill="none"
                                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                  >
                                    <path
                                      d="M8.16064 1.41406V13.1053"
                                      stroke="#303A42"
                                      stroke-width="1.69884"
                                      stroke-linecap="round"
                                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    />
                                    <path
